    {
      "title": "Passive Mode",
      "desc": "The server names a data port",
      "detail": "TYPE I asks for a byte-for-byte binary copy. PASV asks the server to open a port for the data connection. The reply encodes the address and port as six numbers: 195 × 256 + 149 = port 50069. The laptop connects out, which works through NAT.",
